{"t":"Otherworld (Dwarf Bridge)","s":"otherworld-dwarf-bridge-8a53d","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Instable_Breach_Brood_9f3ad7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Otherworld (Dwarf Bridge)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Instable Breach Brood\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Instable_Breach_Brood_9f3ad7.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Deep below the plains south-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, with the entrance <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32520,32021,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32520, 32021, 8)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">90</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">90</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.94<br/>May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Otherworld</b> is a collection of dungeons introduced in the Summer Update 2016. This article is about the Otherworld reachable from a cave near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Bridge\">Dwarf Bridge</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32520,32021,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32520, 32021, 8)</a>. There is also an <a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld%20%28Edron%29\">Otherworld</a> north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld\">main one</a>.\n</p><p>Please note that the entrance to this otherworld is not permanently there. Some times it disappears, but it comes back after some some minutes/hours. \n</p><p>A mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a> takes place here.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster\"><img alt=\"Burster\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burster_9f42b0.gif\" width=\"61\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster\">Burster</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10,000?</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1100+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-44× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li>Crystallized Anger</li>\n<li>Curious Matter</li>\n<li>0-1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bar\">Energy Bar</a></li>\n<li>Energy Drink</li>\n<li>Plasma Pearls</li>\n<li>Spark Sphere</li>\n<li>Volatile Proto Matter</li>\n<li>0-1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\">Great Spirit Potion</a></li>\n<li>Lightning Legs</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Collar%20of%20Red%20Plasma\">Collar of Red Plasma</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Collar%20of%20Green%20Plasma\">Collar of Green Plasma</a></li>\n<li>Ring of Green Plasma</li>\n<li>Ring of Blue Plasma</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Collar%20of%20Blue%20Plasma\">Collar of Blue Plasma</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a></li>\n<li